  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Systematic Observing Financing Facility (SOFF) Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SOFF was created to address the long-standing problem of missing weather and climate observations from Least Developed Countries and Small Island Developing States. It will strengthen the international response to climate change by filling the data gaps that limit our understanding of the climate.</narrative>
  </description>
